\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Schematic of the VNMM-MLPG discretization on a 2D domain $\Omega = [0, \pi ]^2$. For an interior node $\mathbf  {x}_I$, the circular local integration subdomain $\Omega _s^I$ (cyan dashed disk) is completely decoupled from global background grids. The trial interpolation stencil $\Omega _u^I$ consists of 6 admissible neighbor nodes connected by dotted lines. On the boundary, $\Omega _s^B$ intersects $\partial \Omega $, where the tangential director $\mathbf  {t}_B \parallel \partial \Omega $ directly enforces the PEC condition $e_B = 0$.}}{8}{figure.caption.22}\protected@file@percent }
