\newlabel{fig:schematic_mlpg}{{1}{8}{Schematic of the VNMM-MLPG discretization on a 2D domain $\Omega = [0, \pi ]^2$. For an interior node $\mathbf {x}_I$, the circular local integration subdomain $\Omega _s^I$ (cyan dashed disk) is completely decoupled from global background grids. The trial interpolation stencil $\Omega _u^I$ consists of 6 admissible neighbor nodes connected by dotted lines. On the boundary, $\Omega _s^B$ intersects $\partial \Omega $, where the tangential director $\mathbf {t}_B \parallel \partial \Omega $ directly enforces the PEC condition $e_B = 0$}{figure.caption.22}{}}
