\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Asymptotic refinement convergence for VNMM-MLPG under MMS. The observed convergence rates are $\mathcal  {O}(h^{2.06})$ in the $L^2$ field norm and $\mathcal  {O}(h^{1.24})$ in the $H(\mathbf  {curl})$ norm, in full agreement with optimal polynomial approximation theory for linear vector elements.}}{19}{figure.caption.91}\protected@file@percent }
