\newlabel{fig:cavity_modes}{{4}{20}{Physical spectral validation on the 2D PEC resonant cavity: (a) Comparison of the first 10 numerical cutoff wavenumbers $k_c = \sqrt {\lambda }$ against exact analytical values from Table 4-1 of Ortiz (2023) \cite {ortiz2023tese}. (b) Spectral purification parametric sweep: as $s_{\mathrm {div}}$ increases, non-physical gradient spurious modes migrate outward, achieving zero spurious modes in the operational band for $s_{\mathrm {div}} \ge 10$}{figure.caption.99}{}}
